From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Katalyst Contributors <noreply@katalyst.dev>
Date: Wed, 15 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent_ui): allow text selection and copying in thinking previews (#65231)

Make the decorative gradient fade overlay in Thinking previews mouse-transparent
so text selection, dragging, and right-click copying reach the underlying Markdown content.
---
 crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
--- a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
+++ b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
@@ -8219,7 +8219,6 @@ impl ThreadView {
                                         linear_color_stop(panel_bg.opacity(0.8), 0.),
                                         linear_color_stop(panel_bg.opacity(0.), 0.1),
                                     ))
-                                    .block_mouse_except_scroll(),
                             )
                         }),
                 )
